    <div class="lux-brand-news-sheet"><header><p class="lux-brand-news-meta"><span>August 18, 2026</span><span>Event Preview</span><span>Marca China – Guangzhou International Private Label Fair</span></p><h1 id="lux-reader-title">A Taste of Italy Is Here! Discover Italian Innovation in Private Label Food</h1><p class="lux-brand-news-intro">When Italy’s centuries-old culinary traditions meet evolving global consumer demand, an encounter between flavour, quality and innovation begins.</p><a class="lux-brand-news-source" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/adZji0AWAVdNTQsF94_6NQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Original article ↗</a></header><div class="lux-brand-news-copy"><p>From Mediterranean olive oil and traditional Italian sauces to frozen pizza, coffee, dairy products and specialty foods, the Italian Pavilion will bring together outstanding Italian food companies, showcasing authentic flavours, craftsmanship and modern production capabilities.</p><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>From traditional recipes to modern production</h2><p>From carefully selected ingredients at origin to customised private-label solutions, the Italian Pavilion will offer classic specialties while demonstrating product development and supply-chain capabilities for international markets, creating opportunities for retailers, brand owners and professional buyers.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="767" height="323" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-taste-italy.webp'); ?>" alt="Italian Pavilion brands and products at Marca China"></figure></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>LuxurEat</h2><p>LuxurEat combines respect for traditional food culture with an open and innovative approach, focusing on products distinguished by quality, distinctive flavours and reliable traceability.</p><p>The company works closely with trusted partners who share its values, adhering to responsible sourcing and rigorous production standards to bring consumers traditional flavour, reliable quality and innovative experiences.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="1053" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-luxureat-logo.webp'); ?>" alt="LuxurEat brand mark"></figure></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>Product Introduction</h2><p>LuxurEat sauces are rooted in Italian gastronomic culture, product development and craftsmanship. Many signature products are produced and packaged in Italy, while selected caviar and other premium ingredients come from carefully vetted partners in Italy and abroad.</p><p>Venue: Poly World Trade Center Expo, Guangzhou. Dates: September 8–9, 2026.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="772" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-luxureat-sauce.webp'); ?>" alt="LuxurEat truffle sauce products"></figure></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>About Marca China</h2><p>Marca China 2026 is a professional exhibition focused on private label and OEM/ODM supply-chain cooperation. It is expected to cover 10,000 square metres, bring together more than 300 manufacturers and attract over 10,000 professional visitors across food, household, beauty, pet and wellness categories.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="530" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-italian-pavilion.webp'); ?>" alt="Italian Pavilion at Marca China"></figure></section><a class="lux-brand-news-event-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('en/brand', '#event-marca-china-2026')); ?>"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/events/marca-china-2026-poster-160.webp'); ?>" alt=""><span><small>Exhibitions &amp; Events</small><strong>LuxurEat (露意膳) at Marca China 2026</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
